{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach object. If found, take it, move it to designated area. If not found, scan area. Finally, do specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDesignatedArea    /> <Action ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    />",
